      "created_at": "2012-04-27T03:23:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If there are no villain ongoing cards in play, but you have damage boosters (Inspiring Presence, Staff of Ra, Imbue Fire, etc.) does this power still deal damage?  Essentially, does 0 + 1 = 1?  Or does there need to be at least one ongoing card for this to work?</p>",
