      "created_at": "2012-04-27T03:27:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say it still works. Just like if 1 damage is reduced to 0 by Voss but increased to 1 by Galvanize. Although it temporarily became 0 but it’s the final number that counts.</p>",
