      "created_at": "2012-04-27T13:48:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was less interested in exactly how the damage would scale from boosting than whether or not it worked with a base of 0, but yeah, you’re correct, it’s worded the same as Brain Burn.</p>\n<p>In case anyone cares, the reason we wanted to know is because we were playing against The Matriarch, who never has ongoing cards, and we wanted to know if Legacy’s Galvanize would be enough to allow Ra to take out Fowl with Drawn to the Flame <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
