    {
      "id": 29098,
      "name": "dypaca",
      "username": "dypaca",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-16T21:20:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"pppery\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/3d9bf3/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> pppery:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If a card does x damage where x is… it does one instance of damage. if aa card does 1 damage for … it is many instances?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n<p>To use examples in the cards, Visionary's Brain Burn does X damage, where X is the number of cards removed from the villain trash.&nbsp; So if 3 cards were removed, she deals herself&nbsp;1 instance of 3 damage.&nbsp; Tempest's Vicious Cyclone deals 1 projectile damage for each card discarded.&nbsp; If he discards three cards, he will deal 1 damage 3 times, each one being a separate instance of damage.</p>",
